# SOURCE MANIFEST -- Notebook I (Carrollian screening programme)
# Generated 2026-08-01 20:16 UTC
# Environment: CPython (tested under 3.12.3 and 3.13.5) / SymPy 1.14.0 -- see requirements.txt
#
# Gate, in a clean extracted directory:
#     sha256sum -c SOURCE_MANIFEST.sha256 \
#  && python3 verify_notebook_I.py \
#  && python3 test_freeze_gate_mutations.py \
#  && python3 freeze_check.py
#
# freeze_check.py additionally runs divisibility.py's positive/negative controls and
# cross-witnesses test_freeze_gate_mutations.py. All subprocesses are bounded; staged
# mutation cases use a caller-side recursion guard. verify_notebook_I.py self-checks
# this manifest (sec. 11).
#
